# Tractor Beam on Bot2's Memnite: "When this Aura enters, tap enchanted permanent. You control enchanted permanent. Enchanted permanent doesn't untap during its controller's untap step." Memnite becomes Bot1's, tapped; Bot1's untap step on turn 5 leaves it tapped (CR 303.4m, 613.1b, 502.3). An Island is not a creature or Spacecraft, so it is not a legal target (a refusal).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Island
Tractor Beam
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x30

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
! Bot1.Hand.Tractor Beam.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Island)
Bot1.Hand.Tractor Beam.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 0
? Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Tapped = true
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Tapped = true

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Tapped = true
Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 0
